---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contact } from '../../data/profile';
---

<Base title="Privacy & contact">
  <article class="wrap page">
    <h1>Privacy &amp; contact</h1>
    <h2>Responsible</h2>
    <p>{contact.name}, Zurich, Switzerland. Email: <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This is a private, non-commercial portfolio website. It uses no cookies, no tracking and no analytics. Fonts and
      all other files are served by this website itself; no third-party content is embedded.
    </p>
    <p>
      The website is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., USA). When you visit, GitHub processes technically necessary
      data such as your IP address in server logs to deliver and protect the site. Details: GitHub Privacy Statement.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you email me, I use your details only to reply to your message. For access or deletion requests, an email to
      the address above is enough.
    </p>
    <h2>Image credits</h2>
    <p>Logos: ETH Zürich, Forschungszentrum Jülich, CSCS (ALPS), JSC (JUPITER). GH200 photo: NVIDIA. Simulation footage and figures: my own work with the help of artificial intelligence.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: calc(var(--header-h) + 5rem) 6rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
